                                "sense_id": "4e67f790-55ee-3147-b628-3428f94c57bd",
                                "text": "That he who has the time should lack the force, that she who has the force should lack the time! That a trifling and in all probability tractable obstruction of some endocrinal Bandusia, that a mere matter of forty-five or fifty minutes by the clock, should as effectively as death itself, or as the Hellespont, separate lovers."
